0 Uhr: Beratung mit wechselnden Initiativen 17.00 - 22.00 Uhr: Offenes Café mit wöchentlich wechselndem Programm Every Monday, you can visit us at the Kleines Haus from 3 pm; entry is free and so are the drinks, soup and cultural programme. We’re finally back! As usual, the International Women’s Café starts at 3.00 pm. As today is the first Monday of the month, we’ll be sewing together again at the Sewing Café – whether you’re a beginner or an expert, do pop in! From 6.00 pm, we’ll be kicking off the new season together: look forward to a barbecue, live music and a relaxed evening on the terrace. We look forward to seeing you – welcome back to the Monday Café! Here’s what you can expect every Monday at the Monday Café: 3.00 pm – 5.00 pm: International Women’s Café with a children’s play area 5.00 pm – 7.00 pm: Legal consultations with various initiatives 5.00 pm – 10.00 pm: Open café with a programme that changes weekly","score":50.0},{"uid":"862cb62ad5c268f1","title":"Turmführungen auf die schönsten Türme Sachsens","date":"2026-09-07","time":"15:00","venue":"Dom zu Meißen - Hochstift Meißen","category":"fuehrungen","source":"kulturkalender","url":"https://www.kulturkalender-dresden.de/veranstaltung/turmfuehrungen-auf-die-schoensten-tuerme-sachsens","image_url":"https://www.kulturkalender-dresden.de/storage/20641/responsive-images/Johannesglocke-gilt-als-die-figurenreichste-der-Welt___thumb_1200_800.jpg","ongoing":true,"region":"weiter","score":50.0},{"uid":"bcb323edfa24e843","title":"Kinderklub „mineralinos“: Das Mineral Galenit","date":"2026-09-07","time":"15:30","venue":"terra mineralia – Mineralienausstellung der TU Bergakademie Freiberg","category":"familie","source":"kulturkalender","url":"https://www.kulturkalender-dresden.de/veranstaltung/kinderklub-mineralinos-das-mineral-galenit","image_url":"https://www.kulturkalender-dresden.de/storage/59821/responsive-images/10_Galenit-mit-Quarz_Dalnegorsk%2C-Primorski-Kraj%2C-Ferner-Osten%2C-Russland_9-x-5%2C5-cm_0___t